<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Qualitative result of logical operations on a 2D grid domain. We visualize the density on each grid of the true distribution (left), classifier guidance (middle), and ours (right).
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
