<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 5</span>: </span><span id="S6.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Distributions <math id="S6.F5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{M}</annotation></semantics></math> induced by classifier-guided and our mixing policy for fragment-based molecule generation. Each distribution is estimated from 5,000 samples.
Base distributions <math id="S6.F5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SEH}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">SEH</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SEH}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S6.F5.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SA}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">SA</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SA}}</annotation></semantics></math> are shown alongside the composed distribution.
(a) Classifier-guided mixing policy on <math id="S6.F5.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SEH}}\otimes p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SA}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">SEH</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">SA</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SEH}}\otimes p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SA}}</annotation></semantics></math>.
(b) Ours on <math id="S6.F5.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SEH}}\otimes p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SA}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">SEH</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">SA</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SEH}}\otimes p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{SA}}</annotation></semantics></math>.
