<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure A2</span>: </span><math id="A2.F2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.F2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> error for the scalarization of <math id="A2.F2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{Shubert}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">Shubert</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{Shubert}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.F2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{Diagonal}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">Diagonal</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\scriptscriptstyle\mathrm{Diagonal}}</annotation></semantics></math> (<math id="A2.F2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta=1</annotation></semantics></math>) over five preference vectors <math id="A2.F2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\omega}=(\omega_{1},\omega_{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝝎</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\omega}=(\omega_{1},\omega_{2})</annotation></semantics></math>. <em id="A2.F2.5.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">GFN</em> denotes single-objective GFlowNets trained separately for each <math id="A2.F2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\omega}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝝎</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\omega}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
