<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table A4</span>: </span><span id="A2.T4.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Results of logical operators with classifier-guided mixing policy on fragment-based molecule generation. We report the percentage of samples falling into each of 8 bins based on reward thresholds: Fragment-based (SEH: 0.5, SA: 0.6, QED: 0.25). <span id="A2.T4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> indicates the <span id="A2.T4.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">target bin</span>: for harmonic mean (<math id="A2.T4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\otimes" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊗</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\otimes</annotation></semantics></math>), where all objectives are high; for contrast (<span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.T4.m4.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_markedasmath" height="8.06" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-0.81px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 8.06 8.06" width="8.06"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,8.06) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(4.03,0) translate(0,4.03)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 -3.75 C 2.07 -3.75 3.75 -2.07 3.75 0 C 3.75 2.07 2.07 3.75 0 3.75 Z"></path><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 M 3.75 0 C 3.75 2.07 2.07 3.75 0 3.75 C -2.07 3.75 -3.75 2.07 -3.75 0 C -3.75 -2.07 -2.07 -3.75 0 -3.75 C 2.07 -3.75 3.75 -2.07 3.75 0 Z M 0 0"></path></g></svg></span>), where only the first objective is high.</span></figcaption>
