<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure A7</span>: </span><span id="A2.F7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Reward distributions of base models in QM9, illustrating positive correlations between objectives. We observe that (a) High QED samples tend to have high GAP, and (b) High SA samples tend to have high QED.</span></figcaption>
